;  100
;  101    ! EVALUATE_WITH is the value of the tree P with NAME standing for X: the
;  102    ! numerical commands (module FCNUMERIC) evaluate an expression in a
;  103    ! variable they choose the values of, SOLVE X^2 - 2 FOR X, this way. The
;  104    ! name is a frame's one parameter, so it hides a variable of the same
;  105    ! name, and an error is reported at the node it arose in, in the line the
;  106    ! user typed (the frame's column is 0).
