	.PSECT	$CODE,PIC,CON,REL,LCL,SHR,EXE,RD,NOWRT,LONG
;  886
;  887    ! INDEX_LIST makes LIST the positions the index P names, each from 1 to
;  888    ! EXTENT: a range's (lo:hi:stride, lo 1, hi EXTENT, and stride 1 if left
;  889    ! out, as in a Fortran array section), or an expression's values. The
;  890    ! result is false if an index is out of range or not a whole number, ERR
;  891    ! the reason; LIST is then not allocated.
